///|
/// RFC 9535's compliance test suite, in full: 715 cases, of which 249 say that
/// the selector is not one and the rest name the nodelist it must select.
///
/// The table is generated by `scripts/gen_fixtures.py` from the corpus, which
/// is not in this repository. A case is four strings: the name the suite gives
/// it, the selector, the document as JSON text, and the answers as JSON text —
/// an array of nodelists, because nine of the cases allow more than one order
/// and any of them passes. A case whose document is empty is a selector that
/// must be refused.
